        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide full-service design and creative services to assist clients in crafting the right marketing message and developing and building assets and creative for their campaign across the desired platform (i.e., display, social, video, or audio).",
        "start_character": 9161,
        "end_character": 9413
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to growing our local sales force, training our sales personnel and investing in our business to allow us to deepen relationships with our advertisers, including developing new digital products that will allow our content, and our advertisers, to reach a broader audience more frequently and in more locations.",
        "start_character": 22545,
        "end_character": 22871
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate a majority of our advertising revenue by selling directly to local advertisers, as well as to local and regional advertising agencies, which affords us the opportunity to better present our products, cross-sell products and more directly influence their advertising and marketing expenditure decisions.",
        "start_character": 19566,
        "end_character": 19880
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue to develop new products and offerings over time and to better monetize our audiences.",
        "start_character": 24719,
        "end_character": 24826
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of March 9, 2026, we owned and operated 340 radio stations in 74 local markets, importantly all outside the top 50 markets across the United States.",
        "start_character": 15664,
        "end_character": 15815
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2022, we developed our own CRM, Blueprint, as well as an associated app, that was awarded the NAB’s PILOT Technology and Innovation Award.",
        "start_character": 24068,
        "end_character": 24209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the small and mid-sized markets we operate in are generally supported by stable, locally significant institutions such as universities, military bases, state capitals, regional medical centers and retail hubs.",
        "start_character": 31021,
        "end_character": 31243
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our markets, we are among the largest providers of original local content available to consumers.",
        "start_character": 1602,
        "end_character": 1702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Digital Advertising segment, which we market externally as Townsquare Ignite, includes digital advertising on our digital programmatic advertising platform and our owned and operated digital properties.",
        "start_character": 6218,
        "end_character": 6424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The extent of the impact of current economic conditions will depend on future actions and outcomes, all of which remain fluid and cannot be predicted with confidence (including effects on advertising activity, consumer discretionary spending and our employees in the markets in which we operate).",
        "start_character": 33380,
        "end_character": 33676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Townsquare Interactive offers digital marketing solutions, on a subscription basis, to small and medium-sized businesses (“SMBs”) in markets outside the top 50 across the United States, including but importantly not limited to the markets in which we operate radio stations.",
        "start_character": 11169,
        "end_character": 11443
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001499832-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001499832-26-000020-b03c27c763d71347",
        "accession_number": "0001499832-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also leverage our local sales teams in our 74 markets, who enjoy trusted and long-standing local relationships and heritage brand recognition, to sell Townsquare Interactive solutions within our market footprint.",
        "start_character": 14291,
        "end_character": 14506
